# 新一轮修改 @run；每组完成后再进入下一组，不要直接 Run All。
# 异步状态查询需要按 id 找到当前任务并重复查询，直到 DONE / DEAD。
# 快速死信启动参数、预期 SQL 和各阶段金额见同目录 README.md。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8082
@run = manual-001

### A1. 查询初始基线 B、S
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/state

### A2. 模拟扣款已提交但丢失一次 ACK
POST {{base}}/demo/faults?loseAckNext=1

### A3. 下单：先返回 PENDING
POST {{base}}/api/outbox/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "outbox-{{run}}-paid",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### A4. 等待 paid 任务 DONE / PAID，attempts >= 2
# 重复查询本条，达成后才继续；查找 id=outbox-{{run}}-paid
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/tasks

### A5. 确认订单 PAID、余额 B-10、库存 S-1
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/state

### A6. 重复消费，同一事件返回原 PAID
POST {{base}}/api/outbox/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "outbox-{{run}}-paid",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### A7. 同事件编号改数量，预期 409 内容冲突
POST {{base}}/api/outbox/consume
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "outbox-{{run}}-paid",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 2,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### A8. 确认重复消费没有再次扣减
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/state

### B1. 本地消息落库后、提交前故障，预期 409
POST {{base}}/api/outbox/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "outbox-{{run}}-local-fail",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "AFTER_ACCOUNT"
}

### B2. 确认 local-fail 没有任务
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/tasks

### B3. 确认 local-fail 没有订单，余额和库存不变
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/state

### C1. 余额不足场景
# 前提余额小于 1000000，且库存至少 1
POST {{base}}/api/outbox/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "outbox-{{run}}-rejected",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 1000000,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### C2. 等待 rejected 任务 DONE / REJECTED
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/tasks

### C3. 核对取消订单，库存释放、余额不变
# 相对于本轮最初基线，仍为 B-10 / S-1
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/state

### C4. 查询扣款拒绝回执 REJECTED
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/receipts/outbox-{{run}}-rejected

### D1. 模拟接收端持续失败
POST {{base}}/demo/faults?failNext=100

### D2. 创建将进入死信的订单
POST {{base}}/api/outbox/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "outbox-{{run}}-dead",
  "userId": "U1001",
  "productId": "SKU-001",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unitPrice": 10,
  "failAt": "NONE"
}

### D3. 等待 dead 任务进入 DEAD
# 按 README 配置最多 3 次领取可快速验证
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/tasks

### D4. 查询接收端回执，应为 NOT_FOUND
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/receipts/outbox-{{run}}-dead

### D5. 死信时订单仍 PENDING，余额 B-10，库存 S-2
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/state

### D6. 接收端恢复，清零故障
POST {{base}}/demo/faults

### D7. 使用原事件编号重放 DEAD 任务
POST {{base}}/api/outbox/tasks/outbox-{{run}}-dead/replay

### D8. 等待 dead 任务 DONE / PAID
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/tasks

### D9. 最终余额 B-20、库存 S-2，dead 订单 PAID
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/state

### D10. 查询接收端最终回执 PAID
GET {{base}}/api/outbox/receipts/outbox-{{run}}-dead
